}]}}, {"fullName": "Yip R", "lastName": "Yip", "firstName": "Rowena", "initials": "R", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6208-2780"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Diagnostic, Molecular, and Interventional Radiology, Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai, New York, NY."}]}}, {"fullName": "Vliegenthart R", "lastName": "Vliegenthart", "firstName": "Rozemarijn", "initials": "R", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7262-3376"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Radiology, University of Groningen, University Medical Center Groningen, Groningen, the Netherlands."}]}}, {"fullName": "de-Torres JP", "lastName": "de-Torres", "firstName": "Juan P", "initials": "JP", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Pulmonary Department, Clínica Universidad de Navarra, Pamplona, Spain."}, {"affiliation": "CIBER for Respiratory Diseases (CIBERES), Carlos III Health Institute, Madrid, Spain."}]}}, {"fullName": "Neder JA", "lastName": "Neder", "firstName": "J Alberto", "initials": "JA", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Biomedical and Molecular Sciences, Queen's University, Kingston, ON, Canada."}, {"affiliation": "Division of Respirology, Department of Medicine, Queen's University, Kingston, ON, Canada."}, {"affiliation": "Kingston Health Sciences Centre, Kingston, ON, Canada."}]}}, {"fullName": "González J", "lastName": "González", "firstName": "Jessica", "initials": "J", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6847-5315"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Translational Research in Respiratory Medicine, IRBLleida, Arnau de Vilanova and Santa Maria University Hospital, Lleida, CIBER for Respiratory Diseases (CIBERES), Carlos III Health Institute, Madrid, Spain."}]}}, {"fullName": "Seijo LM", "lastName": "Seijo", "firstName": "Luis M", "initials": "LM", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Clínica Universidad de Navarra (CUN), Madrid, Spain."}]}}, {"fullName": "Henschke C", "lastName": "Henschke", "firstName": "Claudia", "initials": "C", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Diagnostic, Molecular, and Interventional Radiology, Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai, New York, NY."}]}}, {"fullName": "Yankelevitz D", "lastName": "Yankelevitz", "firstName": "David", "initials": "D", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7364-4294"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Diagnostic, Molecular, and Interventional Radiology, Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai, New York, NY."}]}}, {"fullName": "Naghavi M", "lastName": "Naghavi", "firstName": "Morteza", "initials": "M", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8112-175X"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "HeartLung.AI, 2450 Holcombe Blvd, Houston, TX 77021."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7364-4294"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8112-175X"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-1451-3080"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6208-2780"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6847-5315"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7262-3376"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-8317-7009"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-9799-8772"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3061-3855"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0009-0004-1060-9271"}]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "6", "volume": "8", "journalIssueId": 4309129, "dateOfPublication": "2026 Dec", "monthOfPublication": 12, "yearOfPublication": 2026, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Radiol Cardiothorac Imaging", "title": "Radiology. Cardiothoracic imaging", "essn": "2638-6135", "issn": "2638-6135", "nlmid": "101748663", "isoabbreviation": "Radiol Cardiothorac Imaging"}, "printPublicationDate": "2026-12-01"}, "pubYear": "2026", "pageInfo": "e260087", "abstractText": "Purpose To evaluate the performance of Sybil, a Medical Open Network for Artificial Intelligence (MONAI)-based nodule model, and their combination for 1-year lung cancer detection in two screening cohorts: the National Lung Screening Trial (NLST) and the Pamplona International Early Lung Cancer Action Program (P-IELCAP). Materials and Methods Baseline low-dose CT (LDCT) examinations from the NLST and the P-IELCAP were analyzed. A prespecified OR-stacked composite model combining Sybil, a MONAI-based nodule model, and a safety-net rule (MONAI-detected nodule > 6 mm with detection confidence > 0.95) was developed and evaluated for 1-year lung cancer detection. Model discrimination was assessed by using area under the receiver operating characteristic curve (AUC), and operating-point performance metrics were calculated. Results A total of 5110 baseline LDCT examinations were analyzed, including 2343 from NLST and 2767 from P-IELCAP, with 65 lung cancers diagnosed within 1 year. Mean age, mean pack-years, and percentage of female participants were 61.6 years ± 5.1 (SD), 57.3 pack-years ± 24.8, and 39.4% (923 of 2343), respectively, in NLST and 56.0 years ± 9.5, 34.4 pack-years ± 21.5, and 28.6% (791 of 2767), respectively, in P-IELCAP. Lung cancer incidence (per 1000 person-years) was higher in NLST than in P-IELCAP (17.7 vs 8.7; <i>P</i> = .006). Mean Sybil 1-year lung cancer probabilities (scaled by 1000 for presentation) were also higher in NLST than in P-IELCAP (16.4 vs 9.9; <i>P</i> < .01). Sybil achieved an AUC of 0.93 in both cohorts, whereas the MONAI-based model achieved AUCs of 0.90 in NLST and 0.79 in P-IELCAP. The composite model missed two of 65 1-year lung cancers while correctly classifying 2731 of 4965 (55.0%) noncancer examinations as negative, yielding a sensitivity of 63 of 65 (96.9%) and a positive predictive value of 63 of 2297 (2.7%). Conclusion For 1-year lung cancer detection with LDCT, the composite AI model achieved high sensitivity while maintaining acceptable specificity. <b>Keywords:</b> Applications-CT, Thorax, Pulmonary, Sybil, MONAI, NLST, P-IELCAP, Lung Cancer, Low Dose Computed Tomography <i>Supplemental material is available for this article.</i> © RSNA, 2026.", "affiliation": "Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, Cornell University, Ithaca, NY.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Comparative Study", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25515", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institutes of Health", "grantId": "N01-CN-75022", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25513", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institutes of Health", "grantId": "N01-CN-25515", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institutes of Health", "grantId": "N01-CN-25512", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25516", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25524", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25511", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "American College of Radiology Imaging Network", "grantId": "U01-CA-79778", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "European Regional Development Fund", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25476", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25512", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "American College of Radiology Imaging Network", "grantId": "U01-CA-80098", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Instituto de Salud Carlos III", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institutes of Health", "grantId": "N01-CN-25513", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "grantId": "N01-CN-25514", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institutes of Health", "gr